    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.099,
                0.459,
                0.117
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、填空题(共5题，每题4分，共20分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.133,
                0.566,
                0.15
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 已知点 A(0,1,2) 和点 B = (1, -1,0)，则  \\( \\overrightarrow{e_{AB}} = \\) ____ .",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.167,
                0.385,
                0.199
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 极限  \\( \\lim_{(x,y)\\to(0,\\pi)}\\frac{\\sin(xy)}{x}= \\)  ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.213,
                0.709,
                0.254
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 设 D:  \\( x^{2} + y^{2} \\leq 1 \\) ，据二重积分的几何意义  \\( \\iint_{D} \\sqrt{1 - x^{2} - y^{2}} dxdy = \\) ____ .",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.078,
                0.266,
                0.744,
                0.306
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 设 L 是抛物线  \\( y^{2}=x \\)  上从  \\( (1,-1) \\)  到  \\( (1,1) \\)  的一段弧，则  \\( \\int_{L} xy dx= \\)  ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.078,
                0.315,
                0.478,
                0.346
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5. 已知 \\(x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2} - 4z = 0\\)，则 \\(\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x} = \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.361,
                0.469,
                0.38
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、计算题(共5题，每题10分，共50分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.388,
                0.304,
                0.422
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 设函数 \\( u = \\frac{y}{x} \\)，求 \\( \\frac{\\partial^2 u}{\\partial x \\partial y} \\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.461,
                0.448,
                0.478
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 求函数: \\(z = x^{2} - y^{3} + 2xy + y + 2\\) 的极值.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.078,
                0.516,
                0.674,
                0.534
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 求曲面： \\( x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2} = 6 \\) 在点 \\( M(1, -2, 1) \\) 处的切平面方程及法线方程.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.078,
                0.577,
                0.648,
                0.624
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 求二重积分： \\( \\iint_{D}\\sqrt{\\frac{1-x^{2}-y^{2}}{1+x^{2}+y^{2}}}dxdy \\) ，其中 D:  \\( x^{2}+y^{2}\\leq a^{2},0<a<1 \\) .",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.667,
                0.467,
                0.7
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5. 将函数: \\( y = \\frac{1}{x^2 - 3x + 2} \\) 展开为 \\( x \\) 的幂级数.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
